INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Darth Plagueis: knowledge and mortality','dossier-plagueis','Legends • Darth Plagueis by James Luceno. The novel presents a Sith investigator whose pursuit of control over mortality intertwines with political ambition and his relationship with Sidious. Canon references Plagueis in Revenge of the Sith, but the novel''s detailed biography belongs to Legends. Study the difference between scientific curiosity and entitlement to control others. Reflection: what limits should remain even when a discovery promises enormous benefits?',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god' AND u.status='active';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Count Dooku: disillusionment and responsibility','dossier-dooku','Canon • Attack of the Clones, The Clone Wars, Tales of the Jedi and Dooku: Jedi Lost. Dooku''s criticism of institutional corruption develops into allegiance to Sidious. His aristocratic bearing and political intelligence do not excuse his choices. Compare legitimate criticism of an institution with the methods chosen to replace it. Exercise: identify a reform that does not require abandoning accountability.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god' AND u.status='active';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Mace Windu: duty, restraint and judgment','dossier-windu','Canon • The prequel trilogy and The Clone Wars. Windu represents senior Jedi leadership during the Republic''s crisis. His decisions illuminate the tension between institutional duty, emergency judgment and uncertainty. Legends expands his characterization in Shatterpoint; keep that account separate. Reflection: what evidence should change a leader''s judgment?',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god' AND u.status='active';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Revan: identity beyond allegiance','dossier-revan','Legends • Knights of the Old Republic and Revan. Revan''s changing allegiances and contested identity make the character a useful subject for examining responsibility across personal transformation. Distinguish player choices from later Legends narrative. Do not assume the complete biography is Canon. Exercise: describe a belief you changed and the obligations that survived that change.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god' AND u.status='active';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Darth Nihilus: appetite without identity','dossier-nihilus','Legends • Knights of the Old Republic II. Nihilus embodies a destructive hunger that overwhelms ordinary identity and relationships. His fictional condition is not a medical diagnosis or attainable power. Compare desire as a source of motivation with desire that consumes every other value. Study the game''s dialogue and consequences rather than treating his destruction as an ideal.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god' AND u.status='active';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Darth Sion: endurance and its limits','dossier-sion','Legends • Knights of the Old Republic II. Sion''s supernatural endurance is inseparable from suffering and attachment to pain. His story invites a distinction between persistence and refusal to change. Real-world resilience does not require injury or deprivation. Reflection: identify when relinquishing a failing strategy is a stronger choice than continuing it.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god' AND u.status='active';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'The Rakata and the Infinite Empire','ancient-rakata','Legends • Knights of the Old Republic and Dawn of the Jedi. The Rakatan empire connects Force-dependent technology with conquest and enslavement. Compare the games'' archaeological discoveries with earlier-era comics. Do not merge all depictions into Canon. Research question: how do technological dependencies shape political institutions and their collapse?',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='galactic-history' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god' AND u.status='active';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'The Kwa and ancient knowledge networks','ancient-kwa','Legends • Dawn of the Jedi and earlier Expanded Universe material. The Kwa are associated with ancient Infinity Gate technology and contact with other civilizations. Their accounts illustrate the fragmentary nature of fictional archaeology. Compare source eras before constructing a chronology. Discussion: what responsibilities accompany sharing powerful knowledge?',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='galactic-history' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god' AND u.status='active';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'The Jensaarai: inherited teachings and reinterpretation','tradition-jensaarai','Legends • I, Jedi. The Jensaarai developed a distinct Force tradition influenced by Jedi and Sith teachings, including a distinctive approach to armor and identity. Their existence complicates a strict two-order taxonomy. Compare how inherited teachings are interpreted rather than assuming that mixed influences automatically resolve ethical contradictions.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='force-studies' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god' AND u.status='active';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'The Aing-Tii: unfamiliar models of the Force','tradition-aing-tii','Legends • The Hand of Thrawn and Fate of the Jedi: Omen. The Aing-Tii present a different conceptual relationship to the Force and are associated with unusual fictional abilities. Their tradition challenges assumptions that all Force users share the same metaphysics. Exercise: distinguish a disagreement about language from a disagreement about ethical conduct.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='force-studies' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god' AND u.status='active';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Exegol: secrecy, ritual and institutional survival','location-exegol','Canon • The Rise of Skywalker. Exegol is associated with the Sith Eternal and Sidious''s hidden operations. Its portrayal connects religious imagery, technological resources and authoritarian continuity. Distinguish cinematic ritual from any proposed real-world observance. Study how secrecy affects accountability and how institutions survive leadership transitions.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god' AND u.status='active';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Holocrons: preserving knowledge across generations','artifact-holocrons','Canon and Legends, separate accounts • The Clone Wars, Rebels and Knights of the Old Republic. Holocrons preserve teachings and may have interactive gatekeepers in fictional accounts. Their properties differ across sources. Knightfall uses the term metaphorically for curated archives and AI tutors, not supernatural artifacts. Exercise: design a source record with provenance, continuity and revision history.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god' AND u.status='active';